<p>Oh no! A critique! Hahahaha<br />
Thanks for the review, friend.</p>
<p>I thought the Foundation would try doing this because they have the Samsara MTF but I am not overly attached to the idea that they have done it to her. I would do it this way just to explore the experiment itself but a Sarkic ritual works just as well. I wanted to avoid adding GoIs but in this case I feel like it is justified.</p>
<p>A drawback for her ability could be that she grows so much more interested and connected to her new reality that she starts to find it difficult to interact and relate to the &quot;normal&quot; reality. Maybe she starts being all &quot;let's use my powers to help people!&quot; and eventually she is &quot;why would I use my powers to help people when there is much more in the universe?&quot;<br />
Kinda a Doctor Manhattan situation?</p>

